      "content": "it just feels like everyone is just waiting for me to get better so they can stop worrying, but nobody actually understands how much it hurts to just exist. i feel like i'm just a burden that people are forced to carry. honestly, is it even bad to want it all to just stop? like, is it wrong to want peace from all this?",
